==English==
{{slim-wikipedia|Plaice (disambiguation)}}
[[File:Hippoglossoides platessoides.jpg|thumb|''Hippoglossoides platessoides''<br>American '''plaice''']]
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|plaiz|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|Late Latin|en}} {{term|platessa|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|πλατύς||broad|lang=grc}}.
===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|plās}}, {{IPA|/pleɪs/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/pleIs/}}
* {{rhymes|eɪs}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|place}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|plaice|pl2=plaices}}

# The large marine [[flatfish]], ''[[Pleuronectes platessa]]'', commonly found in the [[North Sea]] and [[Irish Sea]], with smooth brown skin and red or orange spots.
# The [[flatfish]], {{taxlink|Hippoglossoides platessoides|species}}, of the North American [[Atlantic]]; [[American plaice]].

